======================================================================
Test fixtures
======================================================================

testset/fixtures/ holds frozen copies of public web pages. They are not
covered by the MIT licence of this repository. Each pair keeps its own
licence: Wikipedia text under CC BY-SA 4.0, MDN prose under CC BY-SA 2.5,
Python documentation under the PSF License Version 2, the Rust book under
MIT or Apache-2.0, Django documentation under BSD 3-Clause, Node.js
documentation under MIT, and arXiv papers under CC BY or CC BY-SA.
testset/SOURCES.md lists every pair with its source address, licence and
attribution. Pages whose licence does not allow redistribution are not in
the repository; the test set fetches them on demand into testset/cache/,
which is never committed.

None of the fixtures ship in the extension, the app or the embed script.

